<span class="cat-badge">Guide &middot; Pricing</span>
<h1>Honda Vision vs Automatic Scooter: Hanoi Rental Cost Comparison</h1>
<p>The Honda Vision rents at a verified 200,000 VND per day and 1,000,000 VND per week in Hanoi, with a monthly rate of 1,800,000 to 2,000,000 VND confirmed at the counter as a range. The automatic scooter is not one machine but a category with two verified tiers: the entry tier of Honda Wave, Yamaha Sirius, Yamaha Mio and Honda Click at 150,000 VND per day, and the step-up tier the Vision shares with the Honda Air Blade and the electric motorbike at 200,000 VND per day. This comparison reads the Vision's ladder against the category honestly, including the part most riders miss, which is that the Vision is not an alternative to the automatic scooter, it is the category's most expensive month.</p>
<p>We compare the daily, weekly and monthly structures at both tiers, the break-even logic each ladder produces, what the Vision's premium actually buys as a ride, who each tier suits, and the deposit, gear and support questions that come with either choice. Start at the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental-cost/">Hanoi motorbike rental cost</a> hub, see the full model range at the <a href="/hanoi-motorbike-rental/">Hanoi motorbike rental</a> guide, and check common questions on the <a href="/faq/">rental FAQ</a>.</p>
<nav class="toc">
<ol>
<li><a href="#sec-1">The verified price ladders</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-2">Daily rate comparison</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-3">Weekly and monthly comparison</a></li>
<li><a href="#sec-4">The break-even logic</a></li>
